[{"sha":"cb2d074d25488bc9648e412136fabc2a6a943082","node_id":"C_kwDOFbd6J9oAKGNiMmQwNzRkMjU0ODhiYzk2NDhlNDEyMTM2ZmFiYzJhNmE5NDMwODI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Guillaume Haerinck","email":"guillaume.haerinck@outlook.com","date":"2026-03-10T21:37:37Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-03-10T21:37:37Z"},"message":"Add support for WebAssembly builds of some 3p-packages (#284)\n\n## What does this PR do?\n\nAllow to build several 3p package to the WebAssembly target thanks to\nemscripten compiler\n\nRelated to :\n- https://github.com/o3de/o3de/issues/19083\n- https://github.com/guillaume-haerinck/o3de/tree/emscripten\n\nWhat remains :\n- Emscripten should likely be a 3p-package itself so that users can\ntarget WebAssembly without the need of installing emscripten by themself\n- Need to have all 3p required by the engine/game (and not editor) built\nwith emscripten so that we can build the engine/game itself to\nWebAssembly\n\n## How was this PR tested?\n\nLocal build on windows. \n\nSetup required for now:\n- Install\n[emscripten](https://emscripten.org/docs/getting_started/downloads.html)\n- Install [Ninja build\nsystem](https://github.com/ninja-build/ninja/wiki/Pre-built-Ninja-packages)\n\nSteps:\n- Clone this repository and\n[3p-package-script](https://github.com/o3de/3p-package-scripts) next to\neach other\n- From the 3p package scripts folder, open a terminal and run `python\n.\\build_package.py --search_path ..\\..\\3p-package-source\nLua-5.4.4-rev1-emscripten`\n- Build exit successfully\n- Unzip the created package and check that it is correct\n- (near future) [Link\npackage](https://github.com/o3de/o3de/blob/development/cmake/3rdParty/Platform/Windows/BuiltInPackages_windows.cmake)\nagainst o3de and build tests in webassembly (just need to create a wasm\nfolder in the cloned repo and run `emcmake cmake ..\n-DLY_3RDPARTY_PATH=YOUR_PATH` then build the test targets)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: guillaume-haerinck <guillaume.haerinck@outlook.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e12f026567530075b53c45004fb19c2cdc57105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/git/trees/6e12f026567530075b53c45004fb19c2cdc57105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/git/commits/cb2d074d25488bc9648e412136fabc2a6a943082","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpsI8hCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvrYQAGnOifHmedD997h/wytT3kXt\ntD5BPyewlNFMvFhBhuo1X/OmHy8ZGnpTrkrPrmfT6TLRevI0zmjYbHQYwzo1oy5E\n+GmIa/DeDwAJzl+MfJ4rN0D8PhuaicMAjEQyNzdTr6zjmi5Fve0t5qGFpxCMYEXa\nd9Lm5ZJoB391YaIVmQMc2cXGyfW4VZ3j+aAel7z4NmqIOxwPpp6bY1AsSS1Dq+0c\nVoVOawvmKVb7X+gwmpqAw4YHojZlHm95qz/qve3pNEKPWtx3nohIS3tDli0WEfW4\n6W0TuQfrfUEs/pOIAD/mRUayHb8lDj+Aufb8DCR8Zn8a/X+/hKLqqnWlPdYSw8vp\nnQFNSEX+ZX9U5GBTqwthmGAXhh4CwLNs+UgXm2x4HVyWIu4H/WjXshcN3F/mUUyc\nYLPrY5DMBC2yqgHB8mu83OjlOKp2OFT/KOjhgtbzvJXvDcv5F3/2xXe+46sNthFr\nH9Ns44c3Qn3i9CFGwne4wNPyKMp7ODnyKYHUXERo14kHmqSzCuYm8g8vpNL78cXM\nj+Y7uIYGX3yLDZiOnEHaeKhXdO34USeMzPYkvJTy+30qZM7Hb2iyrKlhMrkM9503\njj4IPIUcrZe1j9ybDhP0JaQHsMcMk3E06hM96dLxeQX++QzqaxCUmhbfPyEXVq1t\nEv2jLCTHI5dUgqRsWREq\n=AIG3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6e12f026567530075b53c45004fb19c2cdc57105\nparent ff433349165e3f994262f05f471ef002154b3574\nauthor Guillaume Haerinck <guillaume.haerinck@outlook.com> 1773178657 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773178657 -0700\n\nAdd support for WebAssembly builds of some 3p-packages (#284)\n\n## What does this PR do?\n\nAllow to build several 3p package to the WebAssembly target thanks to\nemscripten compiler\n\nRelated to :\n- https://github.com/o3de/o3de/issues/19083\n- https://github.com/guillaume-haerinck/o3de/tree/emscripten\n\nWhat remains :\n- Emscripten should likely be a 3p-package itself so that users can\ntarget WebAssembly without the need of installing emscripten by themself\n- Need to have all 3p required by the engine/game (and not editor) built\nwith emscripten so that we can build the engine/game itself to\nWebAssembly\n\n## How was this PR tested?\n\nLocal build on windows. \n\nSetup required for now:\n- Install\n[emscripten](https://emscripten.org/docs/getting_started/downloads.html)\n- Install [Ninja build\nsystem](https://github.com/ninja-build/ninja/wiki/Pre-built-Ninja-packages)\n\nSteps:\n- Clone this repository and\n[3p-package-script](https://github.com/o3de/3p-package-scripts) next to\neach other\n- From the 3p package scripts folder, open a terminal and run `python\n.\\build_package.py --search_path ..\\..\\3p-package-source\nLua-5.4.4-rev1-emscripten`\n- Build exit successfully\n- Unzip the created package and check that it is correct\n- (near future) [Link\npackage](https://github.com/o3de/o3de/blob/development/cmake/3rdParty/Platform/Windows/BuiltInPackages_windows.cmake)\nagainst o3de and build tests in webassembly (just need to create a wasm\nfolder in the cloned repo and run `emcmake cmake ..\n-DLY_3RDPARTY_PATH=YOUR_PATH` then build the test targets)\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: guillaume-haerinck <guillaume.haerinck@outlook.com>","verified_at":"2026-03-10T21:37:38Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/commits/cb2d074d25488bc9648e412136fabc2a6a943082","html_url":"https://github.com/o3de/3p-package-source/commit/cb2d074d25488bc9648e412136fabc2a6a943082","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/commits/cb2d074d25488bc9648e412136fabc2a6a943082/comments","author":{"login":"guillaume-haerinck","id":19243508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjQzNTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19243508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-haerinck","html_url":"https://github.com/guillaume-haerinck","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-haerinck/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-haerinck/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-haerinck/