ub.com","date":"2026-01-26T05:10:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-01-26T05:10:44Z"},"message":"Mac ARM64 3P support: Add definitions for azslc, AWSNativeSDK, lz4, libsamplerate, and SQLite (#335)\n\n* Add definition for azslc-1.8.22-rev1-mac-arm64\n\n  * Added required `pyyaml` pip library to `build-package.yaml`\n  * Add new entry in package-system/azslc/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `azslc-1.8.22-rev1-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for AWSNativeSDK-1.11.361-rev1-mac-arm64\n\n  * Updated package-system/AWSNativeSDK/build_AWSNativeSDK_mac.sh to detect mac arm64\n  * Add new entry in package-system/AWSNativeSDK/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `AWSNativeSDK-1.11.361-rev1-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for lz4-1.9.4-rev2-mac-arm64\n  * Add new entry in package-system/lz4/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `lz4-1.9.4-rev2-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for libsamplerate-0.2.1-rev2-mac-arm64\n  * Add new entry in package-system/libsamplerate/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `libsamplerate-0.2.1-rev2-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for SQLite-3.37.2-rev2-mac-arm64\n  * Add new entry in package-system/sqlite/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `SQLite-3.37.2-rev2-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\nSigned-off-by: Steve Pham <82231385+spham-amzn@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4f9ca90c46255dee65e69a3b865a71827124b3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/git/trees/c4f9ca90c46255dee65e69a3b865a71827124b3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/git/commits/c7efdc07809cb88dd72e10275e896e9a0d62536a","comment