g.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `lz4-1.9.4-rev2-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for libsamplerate-0.2.1-rev2-mac-arm64\n  * Add new entry in package-system/libsamplerate/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `libsamplerate-0.2.1-rev2-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\n* Add definition for SQLite-3.37.2-rev2-mac-arm64\n  * Add new entry in package-system/sqlite/build_config.json for `Mac-arm64` (using alias '@Mac')\n  * Added `SQLite-3.37.2-rev2-mac-arm64` into package_build_list_host_darwin-arm64.json`\n\nSigned-off-by: Steve Pham <82231385+spham-amzn@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-01-26T05:10:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/commits/c7efdc07809cb88dd72e10275e896e9a0d62536a","html_url":"https://github.com/o3de/3p-package-source/commit/c7efdc07809cb88dd72e10275e896e9a0d62536a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/o3de/3p-package-source/commits/c7efdc07809cb88dd72e10275e896e9a0d62536a/comments","author":{"login":"spham-amzn","id":82231385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMjMxMzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82231385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn","html_url":"https://github.com/spham-amzn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spham-amzn/received_events","type